1
00:00:00,682 --> 00:00:05,732
(Penny:)He was supposed to meet you the other
day, but he kind of ended up in jail.

2
00:00:06,271 --> 00:00:10,981
(Stan Lee:)I see. And you thought you'd just
come over to my house uninvited?

3
00:00:11,317 --> 00:00:12,817
(Sheldon:)You said we were invited.

4
00:00:12,986 --> 00:00:17,286
(Penny:)Oh, no, no. I said I'm inviting you
to come with me to Stan Lee's house.

5
00:00:18,032 --> 00:00:20,492
You know, you fanboys are unbelievable.

6
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:24,160
(Stan Lee:)Do you think you can just ring
my doorbell anytime you want?

7
00:00:24,330 --> 00:00:27,880
(Stan Lee:)I mean, why don't you just come on in
and watch the Lakers game with me?

8
00:00:28,877 --> 00:00:32,257
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm not much of a sports fan,
but thank you.

9
00:00:34,090 --> 00:00:37,340
(Penny:)I'm sorry.
He doesn't really understand sarcasm.

10
00:00:37,510 --> 00:00:39,760
(Stan Lee:)Well, I'll give him something
he'll understand.

11
00:00:39,929 --> 00:00:43,269
(Stan Lee:)-Joanie, call the police.
-Nice to meet you.

12
00:00:49,731 --> 00:00:52,061
(Raj:)Fantastic Four, Daredevil...

13
00:00:52,233 --> 00:00:55,443
(Raj:)...Invincible Iron Man,
Happy Hogan, Curt Connors--

14
00:00:55,612 --> 00:00:57,242
(Howard:)Would you just let it go?

15
00:00:58,114 --> 00:01:02,954
(Raj:)And worst of all, Fin Fang Foom.

16
00:01:04,621 --> 00:01:07,831
-Hey. Where you been?
-I'll tell you where I've been.

17
00:01:07,999 --> 00:01:10,919
(Sheldon:)You boys may have had gelato
with Stan Lee...

18
00:01:11,085 --> 00:01:14,755
(Sheldon:)...and gotten autographed comics,
but I saw the inside of his house...

19
00:01:14,923 --> 00:01:19,133
(Sheldon:)...and got an autographed application
for a restraining order.

20
00:01:20,637 --> 00:01:22,717
(Penny:)Sweet.

21
00:01:23,306 --> 00:01:26,306
(Sheldon:)Plus, I get to hang out with him again,
at the hearing.

22
00:01:28,811 --> 00:01:30,311
(Sheldon:)This is going to look great...

23
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:33,820
(Sheldon:)...hanging next to my restraining order
from Leonard Nimoy.

